<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 16px; color: #1a1a1a;">
  <h2 style="font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 8px;">Hi <%= @first_name %>!</h2>
  <p style="color: #555; margin-bottom: 24px;">
    Someone asked for an account with <strong><%= @church.name %></strong> using your details,
    but you already have an account. Sign in with this email address.
    If you've forgotten your password, choose "Set up or reset password" on the sign-in page.
  </p>
  <a href="<%= @url %>"
     style="display:inline-block;background:#6d28d9;color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:99px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;">
    Sign in →
  </a>
  <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #aaa;">
    If you didn't ask for this, you can safely ignore this email.
  </p>
</body>
</html>
